// Whether export i survives emission, mirroring dce.id's own test for a
// function: kept when its owner is reachable, but only in the program itself,
// exactly where dce_prune decides to run at all -- a build with `main`, not
// `--freestanding` (nat_all_live, back/drive/sink/natives/more/live.id).
//
// The test harness keeps every export. It narrows `prog` to the functions a
// case reaches, and a kept function may still read an export whose declaring
// function no case reaches -- a setup the program runs from main. Pruning that
// export left the harness C with an undeclared global (qmon's `qm_qmph`), and
// the saving is one C global, where the narrowing exists to save functions.
// The loose-duplicate canon (mid/form/decomp/checks/loose/)'s own env and
// id 0: a "str" leaf -- uq_begin resets the position map canon_var/
// canon_callee/canon_param read, which env_init's own chain never reaches.
lz_a() {
  fwd_env();
  uq_begin("test");
  export int lz_str = node_str("hi");
} return void;
